    "chunk_text": "\u00d0\u00e6tte unl\u00e6rede ne dyrren underfon lariowdom. Ne eft \u00f0a gel\u00e6redan, \u00f0e sua nylla\u00f0 libban sua hie on bocum leornedon, \u00f0\u00e6t hie sceoldon ne underfon \u00f0a Be \u00f0\u00e6re byr\u00f0enne \u00f0\u00e6s reccenddomes, & hu he scyle eall earfo\u00f0u forsion, & hu forht he sceal bion for Ond hu oft sio bisgung \u00f0\u00e6s rices & \u00f0\u00e6s recedomes toslit \u00f0\u00e6t mod \u00f0\u00e6s recceres. Bi \u00f0\u00e6m \u00f0e magon on ealdordome nytte bion on bisnum & on cr\u00e6ftum, & \u00f0onne for hiora agenre Bi \u00f0am \u00f0e for ea\u00f0modnesse fleo\u00f0 \u00f0a byr\u00f0enne \u00f0\u00e6s lariowdomes; \u00d0onne hie bio\u00f0 ryhtlice ea\u00f0mode \u00f0onne hie ne winna\u00f0 wi\u00f0 \u00f0one godcundan dom. \u00d0\u00e6tte oft \u00f0\u00e6s lariowdomes \u00f0egnung bi\u00f0 sui\u00f0e unt\u00e6lwier\u00f0lice gewilnad, & eac sui\u00f0e unt\u00e6lwyr\u00f0lice Bi \u00f0\u00e6m \u00f0e wilna\u00f0 biscephad to underfonne, hu hie gegripa\u00f0 \u00f0one cuide \u00f0\u00e6s apostoles Paules hira Hu \u00f0\u00e6t mod \u00f0\u00e6tte wilna\u00f0 for o\u00f0re bion, lih\u00f0 himselfum \u00f0onne hit \u00f0enc\u00f0 fela godra weorca to wyrcanne, Huelc se beon sceal \u00f0e to reccenddome cuman sceal. Huelc se beon sceal se \u00f0\u00e6rto cuman ne sceal. Hu se se \u00f0e gedafenlice & endebyrdlice to cym\u00f0, hu he \u00f0\u00e6ron drohtian scyle. Hu se lareow sceal beon cl\u00e6ne on his",
